      "cls": "hx-w-full hx-@container/hx-layout",
      "innerText": "New lair. Same-day WiFi. Get reliable, fiber-powered 300 Mbps WiFi that works right out of the box in your new home. No mayhem, and no contract — cancel anytime. $45/mo for 5 years Shop internet Pricing & other info Offer ends 7/21. New Xfinity Internet members. Restrictions apply. Autopay w/ stored bank account and paperless billing req'd. Taxes and fees extra and subj. to change. Reliability: Xfinity Internet is powered by fiber and connected to premises by coaxial cable. Sign in to start your move as an Xfinity member Look up your new address and see available deals to take with you on move-in day. Sign in",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
